message: >-
  If you use this repository (code, verification tooling, or released
  de-identified evidence), please cite it using the metadata below. To cite
  the research itself, use preferred-citation.
type: software
title: >-
  Alaska Crash Analysis — secure crash-analysis platform and governed,
  reproducible ordinal crash-severity evaluation
