  - traffic safety
  - crash analysis
  - Alaska
abstract: >-
  Governed, leakage-controlled, temporally evaluated ordinal machine-learning
  study of police-reported Alaska crash severity (2009-2012), together with the
  secure Django/React crash-analysis platform from earlier project iterations.
  The MIT license covers the remediation/ source code and documentation only;
  no rights to the restricted Alaska DMV source data are granted, and no raw
  records are distributed. No archival DOI had been issued at the time this
  submission package was finalized; the tagged public release is dated
  July 20, 2026.
